+---
+id: ex-qftx-su2-bv-ghost-master-equation
+kind: example
+title: The SU(2) Ghost Sector Solves the Classical Master Equation
+status: draft
+origin: session
+dependency_level: 4
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
