+
+[Barnich, Brandt, and Henneaux, §§2.3 and 4.1–4.5](https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-th/0002245)
+
+[Gomis, París, and Samuel, §§4.6 and 8.1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-th/9412228)
