+---
+id: def-qftx-local-brst-cohomology
+kind: definition
+title: Local BRST Cohomology Modulo Total Derivatives
+status: draft
+origin: session
+dependency_level: 2
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+deps:
+  - def-qftx-nonabelian-brst-complex
