+
+[Gomis, París, and Samuel, §§4.1–4.6 and 5.2](https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-th/9412228)
+
+[Qiu and Zabzine, §§3.1–3.2 and 4.1–4.4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1105.2680)
