+---
+id: def-qftx-nonabelian-brst-complex
+kind: definition
+title: Finite-Jet Non-Abelian BRST Complex
+status: draft
+origin: session
+dependency_level: 0
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+proof_strategy: definition
+provenance:
+  statement: ai-altered
